    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_AboutTab">About</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_AboutTitle">About Audio Switcher</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_AboutDescription">Audio Switcher brings Windows output, input, game, and media session controls into Playnite Desktop and Fullscreen.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_AboutPurposeTitle">What Audio Switcher does</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_AboutDevices">Switch Windows playback and recording devices from Playnite, choose optional preferred output and input devices, customize names, icons and visibility, and apply a custom volume when a device becomes active.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_AboutProfiles">Create per-game profiles for output, input, Spatial Sound and game-session volume. Profiles can target a specific audio process, temporarily override global preferences and restore the previous devices when the game closes.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_AboutIntegration">Monitor compatible device batteries and use controller-friendly Desktop, Fullscreen and theme integrations for device selection, volume and media sessions. Battery availability depends on data safely exposed by Windows or the hardware.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SupportTitle">Support</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_KoFiSupportHelp">If you find Audio Switcher useful and want to support its development, you can buy Narian a coffee on Ko-fi.</sys:String>
